  "name": "PE pipes by IS 4984",
  "description": "Polyethylene pipes for water supply of IS 4984:2016, PE 100 PN 4 / 6 / 8 / 10 / 12.5 / 16 (SDR 33 / 21 / 17 / 13.6 / 11 / 9) and PE 80 PN 4 / 6 / 8 / 10 (SDR 26 / 17 / 13.6 / 11) at 27 °C, dn 20 to 315 mm: minimum walls of its Table 4 (Amendment 2, 2022); supply reference prices in INR",
