  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "updated": "2026-11-02",
  "author": "OpenCADIrrigation",
  "currency": "INR",
  "pricesSource": "Maharashtra Jeevan Pradhikaran, State Schedule of Rates 2023-24 (in force from 20 June 2023), section I(IX) item 1: PE 100 pipes to IS 4984, 6 / 8 / 10 / 12.5 / 16 kg/cm², 63 to 315 mm, supplied to the departmental stores without couplers, INR per metre without GST. Published rows used as printed; the other sizes and classes from a least-squares fit to the published rows: price = 201.24 INR/kg × mass per metre (PE 960 kg/m³); the PE 80 pipes priced by the same line; the PE 100 PN 4 rows of Corrigendum 1 (4 September 2023) are stated with GST included and are not used.",
